 demo is live for the rest of Next Fest (until 26 October). Recruit up to 20 goblins, crack the armour off a giant beast, haul it home alive and plug it into the grid. If you enjoyed it, a wishlist helps a tiny studio more than anything e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694711","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4991060-1846651706691371","game_id":"steam-4991060","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest is live: capture giant beasts in the free demo","summary":"Steam Next Fest is live! Goblin Electric Ltd. is an auto battler: deploy your goblin crew, watch them fight on their own, and haul giant beasts home alive to power the company. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46287938/518845c55064ae084b158733404c11fbdf700cb1.gif In the free demo Recruit a goblin crew of up to 20 and plan their squads, positions and gear before each battle Break, topple and capture giants alive: the Giant Furnace Toad, the Volt Crab and the Thunderback Tortoise Follow a branching expedition r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691371","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4991060-1846651706685872","game_id":"steam-4991060","kind":"update","title":"Demo update v0.2.2: easier first steps and a capture tutorial fix","summary":"Hi everyone! Thank you to everyone who played the demo or commented on the trailer. Many of you said it wasn't clear what you're supposed to do, and some thought they had to steer every goblin by hand. This update only changes text and menus, so your first run is easier to follow. Battle numbers are unchanged, and your saves still work. Fixes Capture tutorial: the first time you met \"An electrifying slug\", its dialogue didn't play and capturing wasn't unlocked, so the slug just got knocked out. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T00:38:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685872","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4991060-1846651706672817","game_id":"steam-4991060","kind":"announcement","title":"New trailer + new demo: Goblin Electric Ltd. goes on expedition","summary":"Hi everyone! Goblin Electric Ltd. is down to two employees and one very old generator. The plan: hire every goblin who'll work for scrap, march into the Abandoned Power Valley and bring home a giant monster. Alive. Then plug it into the grid. To everyone who played our earlier demo Thank you! In that demo, a small crew roped up creatures and hauled them home before dark. Since then the game has taken a new direction: your crew grows to twenty goblins, you plan the fights instead of steering ever","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T00:57:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4991060-1846018067928434","game_id":"steam-4991060","kind":"announcement","title":"Company memo: the free demo is open now","summary":"Company memo To: everyone who likes tiny goblins From: the Boss, Goblin Electric Limited Subject: The free demo is open now Good news, team. The free demo of Goblin Electric Limited is out now. Hit Download Demo on this page and you can clock in today, ahead of Steam Next Fest (October 19–26). Your job Catch: zap an electric creature until it stops fighting, then tie it up before it wakes. Haul: tow it home on ropes before dark. Heavy cargo tires the crew out, trees snag the lines, and after dar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T05:55:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928434","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4991060-1842846814438940","game_id":"steam-4991060","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Goblin Electric Ltd. — The Steam Page Is Live!","summary":"Welcome to Goblin Electric Ltd. Our Steam page is now live. This is the first public stop for the project, and we are excited to finally show you the factory, its creatures, and the extremely questionable company responsible for keeping the lights on. Goblin Electric Ltd. is a fast single-player 3D arcade-strategy roguelite. Connect two unruly living generators, complete the circuit, and turn the resulting blast into electricity before the fuse burns out. Every MW enters the same Company Battery","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T00:57:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814438940","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:56:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4991060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4991060":"2026-10-26T16:01:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4991060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:05Z"},"4991100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes"